      "content": "Using the maximum lead time seems a bit blunt though, might end up tying up too much capital if we have one really bad outlier shipment. Is there a way to quantify those 'unexplained' delays? Like, when the data shows a gap that doesn't correlate with port congestion or customs issues, it feels almost like there's a hidden variable we aren't seeing in the logs.",
